      "get": {
        "description": "Current Vision State for the caller's scope.\n\nThe scope is the one the authorizer returned, never the one the client\nasked for. 12_SECURITY \u00a74.2 designs the leak out by constructing every query\nalready scoped, and post-filtering here would quietly reintroduce it.",
        "operationId": "vision_state_api_v1_devtools_state_get",
        "responses": {
